  data: {
    LLM: "If you have an Ace of any suit, you have a strong chance for 'Game' points since Aces are worth 4. Protect your Tens!\n\nThe Beg: If you have no trumps or only middle trumps (e.g., 7 or 8), always Beg. You risk giving the dealer a point, but you might find a better suit where you hold the Ace or Two.\n\nLead Management: Since the Jack point is awarded to the winner of the trick (not the holder), use your high trumps to 'fish' for the opponent's Jack if you suspect they have it.",
